-5366-b946-966ce2aa6000" :question/math-academy-id "q-100163" :question/problem "Find the exact solution of the equation ${7}^{x+4}=5.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we take ${log}_{7}$ of both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{7}^{x+4} & =5 \\\\ {log}_{7}⁡({7}^{x+4}) & ={log}_{7}⁡(5)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we use the fact that ${log}_{b}⁡({b}^{c})=c$ to simplify the left-hand side. This gives:\n\n$$\nx+4={log}_{7}⁡(5)\n$$\n\nFinally, we solve for $x,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+4 & ={log}_{7}⁡(5) \\\\ x & ={log}_{7}⁡(5)-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x={log}_{7}⁡(5)-4.$"} {:db/id 17592186544814 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id 17592186110593 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "34f4b65e-b93a-51e8-b943-b3b53d47fffb" :knowledge-point/title "Finding Exact Solutions to Exponential Equations Using Logarithms"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7f147060-2e3d-530e-8605-1ba13a4114d1" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x={log}_{5}⁡(3)" :db/id 17592186544364} {:answer/id #uuid "9dec9e09-3ab9-51d5-93f5-5553f7a2ae1b" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x={log}_{5}⁡(\\frac{1}{3})" :db/id 17592186544429} {:answer/id #uuid "cd163f76-39be-503b-8e02-0fc0fc56c0ca" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x={log}_{3}⁡(5)" :db/id 17592186544521} {:answer/id #uuid "d87bd39e-276b-5919-ae48-a488a12d6528" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x=\\frac{1}{{log}_{3}⁡(5)}" :db/id 17592186544553} {:answer/id #uuid "f4426217-c85d-5fd5-a049-5d1b721018a2" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x={log}_{3}⁡(\\frac{1}{5})" :db/id 17592186544617}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cd163f76-39be-503b-8e02-0fc0fc56c0ca" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x={log}_{